{"id":"claim:diachrony/internal-reconstruction-and-grammaticalization-pathways--earlier-verbal-classifier-system","revision":1,"topic":"topic:diachrony/internal-reconstruction-and-grammaticalization-pathways","topics":["topic:diachrony/internal-reconstruction-and-grammaticalization-pathways","topic:diachrony/internal-reconstruction-and-grammaticalization-pathways--classifiers"],"statement":{"en":"Earlier stages of Ainu likely possessed a larger system of verbal appositive classifiers in possessive constructions than recent varieties.","ja":"初期のアイヌ語には、近年の諸方言よりも大規模な動詞的同格類別詞の体系が所有構文に存在していた可能性が高い。"},"type":"diachrony","scope":{"doculects":["doculect:ainu"],"quantifier":"exists","modality":"epistemic","conditions":[]},"forms":["kor","mi","an-te","hekote","mut","resu","un"],"statements":[{"id":"stmt:bugaeva2022@handbook-epub/l0006-15","stance":"proposes"}],"relations":[],"grouped_by":"act:group/2026-09-10T15-13-12-354Z","status":"grouped"}
{"id":"claim:diachrony/internal-reconstruction-and-grammaticalization-pathways--older-classificatory-verb-inventory","revision":1,"topic":"topic:diachrony/internal-reconstruction-and-grammaticalization-pathways","topics":["topic:diachrony/internal-reconstruction-and-grammaticalization-pathways","topic:diachrony/internal-reconstruction-and-grammaticalization-pathways--classifiers"],"statement":{"en":"An earlier set of classificatory verbs in Ainu is hypothesized to have specified semantic domains such as hunting, animal raising, food preparation, clothing, houses, and functional objects.","ja":"かつてのアイヌ語の類別動詞群には、狩猟・飼育、調理法、衣服、家屋、機能別の物品などを明示する項目が含まれていたと推定される。"},"type":"diachrony","scope":{"doculects":["doculect:ainu"],"quantifier":"exists","modality":"epistemic","conditions":[]},"forms":[],"statements":[{"id":"stmt:bugaeva2021poss@pdftotext-pieces/l0015-01","stance":"proposes"}],"relations":[{"kind":"refines","claim":"claim:diachrony/internal-reconstruction-and-grammaticalization-pathways--earlier-verbal-classifier-system","differs_in":null,"note":"Specifies the particular semantic domains encompassed by the hypothesized older classifier system."}],"grouped_by":"act:group/2026-09-10T15-13-12-354Z","status":"grouped"}
{"id":"claim:diachrony/internal-reconstruction-and-grammaticalization-pathways--verbal-classifiers-replaced-by-kor","revision":1,"topic":"topic:diachrony/internal-reconstruction-and-grammaticalization-pathways","topics":["topic:diachrony/internal-reconstruction-and-grammaticalization-pathways","topic:diachrony/internal-reconstruction-and-grammaticalization-pathways--classifiers"],"statement":{"en":"Earlier specific verbal classifiers in possessive constructions were replaced historically by the verb kor 'have', collapsing multiple alienable classes into a single class.","ja":"所有構文における以前の具体的な類別動詞群は歴史的に動詞 kor「持つ」へと置き換えられ、複数の譲渡可能名詞クラスが単一のクラスへと縮小した。"},"type":"diachrony","scope":{"doculects":["doculect:ainu"],"quantifier":"exists","modality":"epistemic","conditions":[]},"forms":["kor"],"statements":[{"id":"stmt:bugaeva2021poss@pdftotext-pieces/l0015-02","stance":"proposes"}],"relations":[{"kind":"supports","claim":"claim:diachrony/internal-reconstruction-and-grammaticalization-pathways--earlier-verbal-classifier-system","differs_in":null,"note":"Explains how the hypothesized larger system was historically reduced to the modern kor construction."}],"grouped_by":"act:group/2026-09-10T15-13-12-354Z","status":"grouped"}
{"id":"claim:diachrony/internal-reconstruction-and-grammaticalization-pathways--nominalization-development-stages","revision":1,"topic":"topic:diachrony/internal-reconstruction-and-grammaticalization-pathways","topics":["topic:diachrony/internal-reconstruction-and-grammaticalization-pathways","topic:diachrony/internal-reconstruction-and-grammaticalization-pathways--nominalizers"],"statement":{"en":"Nominalization in Ainu developed from zero-nominalization through added nominalizing words to Sakhalin possessive-marked nominalization and its independent main-clause use.","ja":"アイヌ語の名詞化はゼロ名詞化から名詞化語の付加を経て、樺太アイヌ語の所属形的一致を伴う形式およびその独立主節用法へと発展した。"},"type":"diachrony","scope":{"doculects":["doculect:hokkaido","doculect:sakhalin"],"quantifier":"exists","modality":"epistemic","conditions":[]},"forms":["v-poss"],"statements":[{"id":"stmt:bugaeva2016@pdftotext-pieces/l0014-05","stance":"proposes"}],"relations":[],"grouped_by":"act:group/2026-09-10T15-13-12-354Z","status":"grouped"}
